<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Printrivo Image Studio</title><meta name="description" content="Prepare one image for print: backgrounds, trimming, color adjustments, text, and high-resolution PNG export.">
<link rel="icon" href="<?= base_url('assets/img/printrivo_light_logo.png') ?>">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="<?= base_url('assets/css/image-studio.css?v=20260920-header') ?>">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="<?= base_url('assets/css/report-bug.css') ?>">
</head><body>
<header class="studio-header"><a class="brand" href="<?= site_url('dashboard') ?>"><img src="<?= base_url('assets/img/printrivo_light_logo.png') ?>" alt="Printrivo" width="110" height="60"><span class="studio-brand-title">Image Studio</span></a><div class="header-actions"><a href="<?= site_url('dashboard') ?>">Dashboard</a><?= view('partials/report_bug_button') ?><button id="open">Open image</button><button id="export" class="primary" disabled>Export PNG</button></div></header>
<input id="file" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" hidden>
<div class="document-bar"><span id="filename">Untitled artwork</span><div><button id="undo" disabled>Undo</button><button id="redo" disabled>Redo</button><button id="reset" disabled>Reset image</button><button id="clear-image" disabled>Clear image</button></div></div>
<main class="studio-layout">
<aside class="tools panel" aria-label="Image editing tools">
<p class="eyebrow">PREPARE YOUR ARTWORK</p><h1>Image tools</h1>
<fieldset id="image-tools" disabled>
<details open><summary>Background &amp; trim</summary><p class="hint">Keep your background, or remove an edge-connected solid color. Best for artwork on plain backgrounds.</p><label>Background tolerance <input id="tolerance" type="range" min="0" max="120" value="20"></label><button id="remove-bg">Remove background</button><button id="trim">Trim transparent margins</button>
<div class="grid"><label>Crop X (px)<input id="crop-x" type="number" min="0" value="0"></label><label>Crop Y (px)<input id="crop-y" type="number" min="0" value="0"></label><label>Width (px)<input id="crop-w" type="number" min="1" value="1"></label><label>Height (px)<input id="crop-h" type="number" min="1" value="1"></label></div><button id="crop">Apply crop</button></details>
<details open><summary>Size &amp; print</summary><div class="grid"><label>Print width (in)<input id="print-width" type="number" min="0.01" step="0.01" value="1"></label><label>Print height (in)<input id="print-height" type="number" min="0.01" step="0.01" value="1"></label></div><label>Export DPI<select id="dpi"><option>150</option><option selected>300</option><option>600</option></select></label><button id="resize">Resize to print dimensions</button><div class="grid"><button id="upscale2">Upscale 2×</button><button id="upscale4">Upscale 4×</button></div><p class="hint">Dimensions stay proportional. Upscaling uses smooth resampling; it cannot recover missing detail. Maximum 24 megapixels.</p><div class="grid"><button id="rotate">Rotate 90°</button><button id="flip">Flip horizontal</button></div><p class="hint">Rotate and flip flatten text into the image. Undo restores editable layers.</p></details>
<details><summary>Color adjustments</summary><label>Brightness<input id="brightness" type="range" min="-100" max="100" value="0"></label><label>Contrast<input id="contrast" type="range" min="-100" max="100" value="0"></label><label>Saturation<input id="saturation" type="range" min="0" max="200" value="100"></label><button id="colors">Apply adjustments</button><div class="grid"><label>Replace color<input id="from-color" type="color" value="#ffffff"></label><label>With color<input id="to-color" type="color" value="#000000"></label></div><label>Color tolerance<input id="color-tolerance" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="15"></label><button id="replace-color">Replace matching color</button><p class="hint">Color adjustments affect the image. Text colors remain independently editable.</p></details>
</fieldset></aside>
<section class="workspace" aria-label="Artwork canvas"><div class="canvas-toolbar"><span id="dimensions">Open an image to begin</span><label>Zoom <select id="zoom"><option value="fit">Fit</option><option value=".25">25%</option><option value=".5">50%</option><option value="1">100%</option><option value="2">200%</option></select></label><label>Preview <select id="backdrop"><option value="checker">Transparency</option><option value="white">White</option><option value="dark">Dark</option></select></label></div><div id="stage" class="stage"><div id="empty"><strong>Your artwork, ready for its next step.</strong><p>Drop one PNG, JPG, or WebP here.</p><button id="open-empty" class="primary">Open image</button><small>Edits stay in your browser. Your original file is untouched.</small></div><canvas id="canvas" hidden aria-label="Image preview. Use text position inputs for precise placement."></canvas></div><p id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Open a single image. Nothing is removed or changed automatically.</p></section>
<aside class="inspector panel" aria-label="Text layers and print information"><p class="eyebrow">MAKE IT YOURS</p><h2>Text &amp; layers</h2><fieldset id="text-tools" disabled><button id="add-text">+ Add text layer</button><label>Selected layer<select id="layers"><option value="">Image only</option></select></label><div id="text-properties" hidden><label>Text<textarea id="text" rows="3" maxlength="1000">Your text</textarea></label><div class="grid"><label>Font<select id="font"><option value="Arial">Arial</option><option value="Georgia">Georgia</option><option value="Verdana">Verdana</option><option value="Impact">Impact</option><option value="monospace">Monospace</option></select></label><label>Size (px)<input id="font-size" type="number" min="6" max="2000" value="72"></label><label>Color<input id="text-color" type="color" value="#000000"></label><label>Weight<select id="weight"><option value="400">Regular</option><option value="700">Bold</option></select></label><label>X (px)<input id="text-x" type="number" step="1" value="0"></label><label>Y (px)<input id="text-y" type="number" step="1" value="0"></label></div><button id="delete-text">Delete text layer</button><p class="hint">Drag text on the canvas or enter its position. New layers appear above earlier layers.</p></div></fieldset><section class="print-check"><h2>Print check</h2><p id="print-info">Image dimensions, transparency, and output size appear here.</p><p class="hint">PNG export uses RGB color with transparency. Confirm your printer’s color and size requirements.</p></section></aside>
</main>
<script src="<?= base_url('assets/js/studio-image.js') ?>"></script>
<script src="<?= base_url('assets/js/image-studio.js?v=20260920-clear-image') ?>"></script>
